*** SUPPORT AND FEEDBACK ***

Please share bug reports and documentation feedback at
https://github.com/mflood/rudeconfig/issues

Helpful reports include a description of the behavior, the relevant input,
the expected result, and the observed result. Where applicable, please include
a minimal data file that reproduces the behavior.

Project support and discussion have moved from the earlier rudeserver.com
addresses to GitHub Issues.


